 "title": "Generator of a triangulated category",
 "statement": "Let C be a triangulated category [def-weil-triangulated-category]. An object E is a generator if every nonzero object K of C admits an integer n and a nonzero morphism E \\to K[n]. A family (E_i) generates C when its coproduct is a generator.",
